  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the Diocesan Commissions&apos; Capacity to Work w/Children Affected by HIV/AIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project intends to improve the capacity of the Diocesan volunteers in address the challenges faced by children affected by HIV/AIDS, mainly the stigmatization, descrimination, nutrition and general support throughout the country. It will relay on building the capacity of 20 volunteers per each of the 20 Dioceses in the country and these volunteers will then assist directly the children.</narrative>
  </description>
